      "content": "I understand how you feel, but it's not about delaying the inevitable. It's about finding meaning in the moment, even if the universe is heading towards its end. Sometimes, the only thing that matters is how we live our lives and how we affect those around us. So, why not make the most of it, even if it's just for a little while?",
